There are a couple of monsters confering something that in r.g.r.n. is
called teleportitis; these are mainly leprechauns, nymphs and tengu.
Avoid to eat them if you have no means of teleport control. You can get
teleport control by a ring or by eating a tengu.  Remember that tengu
will also give you teleportitis, but since you already have it eat a
tengu corpse if you find one, in other cases better avoid to eat them.
There is no safe way to get teleportitis removed from you, so the best
thing for your current character is to somehow get teleport control (TC).
If you have TC then teleportitis is yet an advantage.
Be cautious picking up things in shops, BTW.

